&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in contemporary software engineering approaches, including CI/CD, version control and unit testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developing web services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to maintaining extreme rigor in all job-related activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Previous experience working with language models or other similar NLP technologies.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and delivering products (not necessarily ML-related) in a dynamic startup-like environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering skills, including experience in developing large distributed systems or high-load web services.&lt;/li&gt;
